## Key Design Decisions

| Concern | Solution |
|---------|----------|
| **Runtime extensibility** | Registry pattern allows adding new Job types without modifying core engine |
| **Isolation** | Deep copy of context ensures each step operates on its own data |
| **Error propagation** | Failed steps throw immediately; retry logic handles transient failures |
| **Ordering guarantees** | Explicit `dependsOn` array ensures deterministic execution order |
| **Parallel execution** | Flag available for orchestrator to batch independent steps |
